  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **walk on**: back after 151 archived shows (719 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Back Up and Push ( cover)**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Froggie Went A-Courting ( cover) (Billy Stings on guitar, Billy Failing on banjo)**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Jeff Sturgeon (Billy Strings on clawhammer banjo, Alex Hargreaves on fiddle)**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Dust & Regret ('Dust in a Baggie' lyrics to… more )**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Fiddling Around (Jeff Austin cover)**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings23-07-23.audmtx.hsm.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 147 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper positioned at the front left corner of the front-of-house area at Champlain Valley Fairgrounds, with permission to record [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings23-07-23.audmtx.hsm.flac24**: taped by Hunting Sound Man; transferred by Hunting Sound Man; source: Beyerdynamic MC930 + Beyerdynamic M700 -> MixPre-6 II (32/96) [1]. Also: Recorded, mixed and mastered by Hunting Sound Man using Beyerdynamic MC930 and M700 microphones into a MixPre-6 II at 32-bit/96kHz; Post-production: Audacity for normalizing, tracking and mixing; Reaper converted to 24/96; encoded to FLAC level 8 with TLH, tagged with Tag&Rename [1]",
